UID:8f22828459a16dae10513f666cfe6a56@sebarts.org
DESCRIPTION:Collage on Panel from Start to Finish\, 8/16\n\n  \n    \n    
   \n        \n          $130.00\n        \n      \n    \n  \n\nSunday\, Au
 gust 16\, 2026\; 11 AM - 3 PMFee: $115 + $15 materials feeAge: 16+ Join Fr
 ench-American collage artist Catherine Cruz for a new comprehensive collag
 e workshop designed to to guide you through the complete process of creati
 ng a finished collage on wood panel. Her hands-on process will cover every
  step—from surface preparation and design to varnishing and wiring.  You
  will learn presentation tips to give your artwork a professional finish. 
  What you’ll obtain from this workshop: Reliable methods for preparing y
 our panel\, Technical information about selected art materials\, Creative 
 ways to explore abstraction through collage\, Techniques for presenting yo
 ur art.IMPORTANT: Each participant must purchase and bring the following i
 tems listed in the attached PDF.  The class will begin with a demonstratio
 n\, so please plan to arrive early to allow time to settle in.A short lunc
 h break will be held from 12:30 to 1:00 PM. Kindly bring your own lunch an
 d beverage.About the instructor: Catherine Cruz is a French-American artis
 t whose work is informed by textures and patterns created by the passing o
 f time and the effects of the natural elements on the built environment.  
 She holds a Bachelor of Science in interior design and she worked in the f
 ield of architectural design and green building certification for over 25 
 years.  She has taught collage and mixed media workshops in the Bay Area a
 nd in France since 2019\, and this is her fifth year at the Sebastopol Cen
 ter for the Arts.  Her studio is located in Sebastopol and she participate
 s in Art Trails Open Studios.  You may contact Catherine at beyouartstudio
 @gmail.com.  Check out Catherine’s other classes here:  https://wwws.seb
 arts.org/visual-arts-classes.\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\
